      "content": "\"use client\"\n\nexport { HangingBag, type HangingBagProps } from \"./hanging-bag\"\nexport {\n  DEFAULT_HANGING_BAG_ITEMS,\n  type HangingBagItem,\n  type HangingBagLineItem,\n  type Project,\n  projects,\n} from \"./projects\"\n",
